    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "実はうち、今度モデルの仕事をすることになったばい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、そういえばプロデューサーが言っていたね\r\nたしか、ティーン向けの雑誌だったかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうなんよ！　そいで早速練習しよう思ったんやけど\r\n全然思ったようにできんたい……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それで、きっと咲耶ならモデルの極意ば知っとーと思って！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど……フフ、極意は難しいけど、\r\n基本的なことなら教えられるかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ホントね！？　咲耶ー、ありがとー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "よかったねー。じゃあ、私はこれでー……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "待たんね！　摩美々も一緒に教えてもらうと！\r\nうちと一緒に、トップモデルを目指すたい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー……\r\n……じゃ、見学だけねー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス、じゃあさっそく始めようか",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よーし！　頑張るけんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まずは、いろんな表情を作ってみよう\r\nモデルは服に合わせて、様々な表情を作るからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "じゃあ最初に……ちょっと微笑んでみようか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "これでどげんね！？",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "うん、とても素敵だね\r\n恋鐘らしい元気でいい笑顔だと思う",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020200,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "微笑みって言うかぁ、ハツラツって感じじゃないー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それじゃあ、今度は物憂げな表情をしてみてくれるかい？",
