    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020300,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "いつの間に勝負になってたのー？\r\nそれにー、今の恋鐘じゃぁ、勝ち目なくないー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600202/3006002020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006002020310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "しかし、恋鐘の笑顔はとても可愛かったよ\r\n雑誌の表紙を飾っても申し分ないくらいだ",
